<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cowen cuts VTEL Corp.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cowen cuts VTEL Corp.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co said said it cut its rating on VTEL Corp to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- On Tuesday, VTEL and Compression Labs Inc agreed to merge in a stock-for-stock deal valued in excess of $80 million.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- VTEL lost 5/8 to 8-7/8 in morning trading.</p>
</text>
